@startuml Sequence_Registration_Conformance
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Admin as "Administrator"
actor Client as "Client Node"
participant Gateway as "FastAPI Gateway\n(behind Caddy, HTTPS)"
participant Conformance as "Conformance Validator\n(in Gateway)"
database DB as "PostgreSQL"

== Approval (before the client connects) ==
Admin -> DB : Admin CLI: add client to approved list\n(stores client_id + hashed token)
Admin --> Client : Client token delivered out of band\n(never inside the client image)

== Registration ==
Client -> Gateway : POST /register (client_id, client_version = image tag + digest,\nprotocol_version) + Bearer token
Gateway -> DB : Verify token hash & approved list

alt Token invalid or client not approved
    Gateway --> Client : 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden
else Managed-code client with unapproved version
    Gateway -> DB : Log rejection (version mismatch)
    Gateway --> Client : 403 Forbidden (version not approved)
else Accepted
    Gateway -> DB : Save client as REGISTERED
    Gateway --> Client : 200 OK (current manifest version)

    == Conformance Check ==
    Client -> Gateway : GET /conformance/{manifest_version}
    Gateway --> Client : Manifest (JSON) + synthetic reference inputs
    Client -> Client : Run conformance checker locally\n(no raw data leaves the client)
    Client -> Gateway : POST /conformance/report\n(metadata + pass/fail + outputs on reference inputs)
    Gateway -> Conformance : Re-check report
    note over Conformance
      Checks:
      1. Model architecture/version, parameter names & tensor shapes
      2. Feature names, ordering and data types
      3. Pre-processing & categorical encoding versions
      4. Feature units, label semantics & ranges
      5. Client outputs on reference inputs == expected outputs
    end note

    alt Mismatch detected
        Conformance --> Gateway : Fail (reason, e.g. "feature_order_mismatch")
        Gateway -> DB : Store failed report + reason (conformance_reports)
        Gateway --> Client : 422 Unprocessable Entity (rejection details)
    else All checks pass
        Conformance --> Gateway : Pass
        Gateway -> DB : Store passing report for this manifest version
        Gateway --> Client : 200 OK (client may be selected for rounds)
    end
end

note over DB
  The coordinator only selects clients with a passing
  report for the current manifest version.
end note
@enduml
